recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the key is seated and the guard is on the roster, so the next row books from xy and a collision refuses before it ships rather than after two rebases. Two doors left, both yours: %281 and %291's one-tree-per-star-or-a-lock, which this deliberately did not touch, and Moves 2 through 7 of the same design, still proposals. Dream's own lane is now clear to open core-first: Caravan and Tally green, then the constellation table.
